<title>CHINA: Pudong Development Bank in 1.25 bln yuan profits.</title>
<headline>Pudong Development Bank in 1.25 bln yuan profits.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai's Pudong Development Bank reported annual profits for last year of 1.25 billion yuan ($150 million), the China Daily Business Weekly said on Sunday.</p>
<p>That ranked it ninth among China's banks last year.</p>
<p>Its total assets were 65 billion yuan at end-1996, it said.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>($1.0=8.3 yuan)</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 65321921</p>
</text>
